SUMMARY:qBitControl v1.4.1
DESCRIPTION:qBitControl 1.4.1 | qBitControl\n\n## 📊 Performance & Effici
 ency\n\n- **Reduced Data Usage:** Network traffic reduced by **93%** thank
 s to optimized data syncing.\n- **Smooth Charts:** Statistics charts now s
 croll continuously and smoothly instead of updating every two seconds.\n- 
 **Responsive Progress Bars:** Progress indicators now feature fluid animat
 ions for a more natural feel.\n\n## 🛠️ Interface & Usability\n\n- **C
 ustom Headers:** Specify custom HTTP headers for server connections—offe
 ring seamless support for reverse proxies and zero-trust networks (e.g.\, 
 Cloudflare Access\, Authelia).\n- **Reworked Server Addition:** Redesigned
  server setup and edit screens with an updated *Advanced* settings page an
 d deferred saving.\n- **Limit Configuration:** Configure precise speed lim
 its\, seeding time limits\, and share ratios for individual torrents direc
 tly in-app.\n- **Cleaner Torrent List:** Torrent rows now adapt dynamicall
 y to show the most relevant details depending on whether a transfer is dow
 nloading\, seeding\, or paused.\n- **Repositioned Add Button:** Moved the 
 "Add Torrent" button to the toolbar for cleaner\, more intuitive access.\n
 - **Offline Banner:** A clear overlay banner now appears whenever your con
 nection drops.\n- **In-App Logs:** Added a built-in log viewer to review a
 nd easily share system events directly inside the app.\n\n## 🐛 Fixes & 
 Refinements\n\n- **Self-Signed Certificate Support:** Full support for unt
 rusted and self-signed SSL certificates\, making it easier to connect to h
 ome-hosted servers.\n- **Stable RSS Downloads:** Fixed an issue in the RSS
  view where tapping a row to download a torrent caused the confirmation sh
 eet to glitch and reopen unexpectedly.\n- **Connection Timeouts:** Impleme
 nted strict network timeouts to prevent the app from hanging indefinitely 
 on the launch screen if a server is unresponsive.\n- **Clearer Error Alert
 s:** If adding a `.torrent` file or magnet link fails\, a clear error mess
 age now pops up explaining what went wrong.
